# Always install and lock optional dependencies. Some of our dev tooling (wrangler
# -> sharp) pulls platform-specific optional packages (@img/sharp-* and their
# @emnapi/* deps). If a local `npm install` prunes them from package-lock.json
# (e.g. a machine with `omit=optional` set), the Linux Cloudflare build and CI —
# which run `npm ci` — fail with "Missing: @emnapi/... from lock file". Forcing
# optional here keeps the lockfile complete and cross-platform.
include=optional
